    $('#soundButton').addEventListener('click',speakWord); $('#learnNewWord').addEventListener('click',()=>{const library=$('#wordLibrary').value;state.wordJourney={...freshWordJourney(),library};save();showStudyTab('review');renderReviews();});$$('[data-reading-source]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>selectReadingSource(button.dataset.readingSource)));
